{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着人工智能技術快速發展，關於AI被用於發起大規模網絡攻擊的擔憂正在升温。微軟行政總裁薩提亞·納德拉近日在公開活動中表示，全球範圍內存在大量「無法打補丁」的關鍵基礎設施系統，這些設備和平台可能在未來面臨越來越嚴峻的安全挑戰。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587028.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.443616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:50:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_hash":"f421a5a9c1591c132a3e64223556dc2d7190d0ed17a4ac29f94c984a99820c4a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}